e-um09fdqns3raclp,ilve-um09fdqns3rag,ilve-um09fdqns3raglp,ilve-um09fdqns3rap,ilve-um09fdqns3raplp,ilve-um09fdqns3ssb,ilve-um09fdqns3ssblp,ilve-um09fdqns3ssc,ilve-um09fdqns3ssclp,ilve-um09fdqns3ssg,ilve-um09fdqns3ssglp,ilve-um09fdqns3ssp,ilve-um09fdqns3ssplp,ilve-um09fdqns3whb,ilve-um09fdqns3whblp,ilve-um09fdqns3whc,ilve-um09fdqns3whclp,ilve-um09fdqns3whg,ilve-um09fdqns3whglp,ilve-um09fdqns3whp,ilve-um09fdqns3whplp\", \"Variant Count\": 160, \"Variant HTML\": \" <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_description\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel station-tabs-default-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_description\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><p>The Majestic 36\\\" dual fuel range combines cutting-edge technology with traditional Italian design. This line includes six gas burners and a griddle, each with a 3.5 cu. total black brass burner with a non-stick nanotechnological coating. sq. total oven capacity, 4.3-inch full touch oven control display, and easily cleaned enamel oven cavity.</p><p>Pre-Order (90\\u2013120 Days)</p><div><p><strong>Magnificent</strong></p><p>The eye-catching range cooker that makes your kitchen distinctive.</p><p></p><p>Majestic is a daring, expert representation of the ideal range cooker, combining beauty and functionality. A free-standing statement piece with a style that features rounded lines, expertly crafted details, exquisite finishes, solutions, and technologies straight from the world of professional cooking that instantly takes center stage and blends into any setting.</p><p></p><p>The rounded shapes of majestic range cookers, which are crafted from pure steel with meticulously made details, make them aesthetically pleasing appliances.</p><p></p><p>They are genuine works of art, created for your home's kitchen. They come with exquisite metallic finishes and are offered in a variety of chosen colors or in RAL Classic shades upon request. They are available in a variety of sizes (from 30 to 60 inches) and provide a number of setup options. There are three cooktop (hob) configurations to choose from: fry top, dual gas burners, and induction models up to 40 inches in size.</p><p></p><ul><li>Dual gas burners with a maximum power of 20,000 BTU are standard.</li><li>Highly specialized cooktops</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li><li>4.3\\\" Digital Touch Screen Display</li><li>Black brass burner with non-stick coating<br/>Nanotechnological coating</li><li>Cooktop with cast iron pan supports.</li><li>Soft-closing door and drawer</li><li>Steam release for moist cooking</li><li>True, stand-alone warming drawer</li><li>Probe for cooking</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Product Technologies</strong></p><p>Aesthetics are important, but that's not all. To cook well and enjoyably, the best technologies are required. In order to consistently ensure the highest level of satisfaction, ILVE puts all of its research and experience to work for you, providing solutions that combine optimal performance with maximum simplicity, safety, and user-friendliness.</p><p></p><p><span><strong>Cooktop (Hob) Technology</strong></span></p><p></p><p><strong>Dual Gas Burners with Up to 20,000 BTU Power as Standard For all cooking methods, the ideal supply and distribution of heat.<br/></strong>Dual Gas Burners with Up to 20,000 BTU Power as Standard For all cooking methods, the ideal supply and distribution of heat.</p><p><strong>Highly Customized Cooktops The structure is made of AISI 304 steel and has a thickness of 12/10. You can choose between an induction cooktop or a gas cooktop (hob) with up to 9 burners, mixed, and in different configurations.<br/></strong>Highly Customized Cooktops The structure is made of AISI 304 steel and has a thickness of 12/10. You can choose between an induction cooktop or a gas cooktop (hob) with up to 9 burners, mixed, and in different configurations.</p><p><strong>Total Black Brass Burner with Nanotechnological Non-Stick Coating A nanotechnological coating that guarantees easy cleaning and an elegant Total Black finish enhance the noble technical qualities of brass.<br/></strong>Total Black Brass Burner with Nanotechnological Non-Stick Coating A nanotechnological coating that guarantees easy cleaning and an elegant Total Black finish enhance the noble technical qualities of brass.</p><p><strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports The pots are safely and effectively supported by the unbreakable cast iron pan supports.<br/></strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports The pots are safely and effectively supported by the unbreakable cast iron pan supports.</p><p></p><hr/><p></p><p><span><strong>Oven Technology</strong></span></p><p></p><p><strong>The Ovens: Magnificent Size and Performance. Any single or double combination oven you select will give you all the space you require, even for large dishes. Our 36-inch range has an oven capacity of up to 4 cubic feet.<br/></strong>The Ovens: Magnificent Size and Performance. Any single or double combination oven you select will give you all the space you require, even for large dishes. Our 36-inch range has an oven capacity of up to 4 cubic feet.</p><p><strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.<br/></strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.</p><p><strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.<br/></strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.</p><p><strong>User-Friendly, Comprehensive, and High Resolution TFT Display. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glance, you can control the temperature, timer, and automatic cooking start and end programmer.<br/></strong>User-Friendly, Comprehensive, and High Resolution TFT Display. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glance, you can control the temperature, timer, and automatic cooking start and end programmer.</p><p><strong>Soft-Closing Door A shock absorber installed in the door hinges allows for a more gradual and silent closing.<br/></strong>Soft-Closing Door A shock absorber installed in the door hinges allows for a more gradual and silent closing.</p><p><strong>Warming Drawer with Soft Closing System While you wait for your guest to arrive or for another meal to be prepared, keep your cooking warm. A useful feature for keeping the ideal temperature to showcase your culinary prowess You can also use the compartment as a storage drawer for your pots, pans, and cooking utensils when it's not in use.<br/></strong>Warming Drawer with Soft Closing System While you wait for your guest to arrive or for another meal to be prepared, keep your cooking warm. A useful feature for keeping the ideal temperature to showcase your culinary prowess You can also use the compartment as a storage drawer for your pots, pans, and cooking utensils when it's not in use.</p><p><strong>Cooking Probe An indispensable tool for determining the core temperature, such as in meat cuts.<br/></strong>Cooking Probe An indispensable tool for determining the core temperature, such as in meat cuts.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Steam You can select a drier or more moist cooking method thanks to this system, which removes the vapors from inside the cavity. You can produce a soft and juicy roast or a crispy baked dish in this manner.<br/></strong>Cooking with Steam You can select a drier or more moist cooking method thanks to this system, which removes the vapors from inside the cavity. You can produce a soft and juicy roast or a crispy baked dish in this manner.</p><p><strong>Temperature ranging from 85\\u00b0 to 575\\u00b0 F ILVE ovens make it simple to prepare intricate and sophisticated recipes with flawless results, from proofing to cooking, roasting to low temperature.<br/></strong>Temperature ranging from 85\\u00b0 to 575\\u00b0 F ILVE ovens make it simple to prepare intricate and sophisticated recipes with flawless results, from proofing to cooking, roasting to low temperature.</p><p><strong>High-Density Insulation and Ventilation for Tangential Cooling Prevents the kitchen and the furniture near the oven from getting too hot.<br/></strong>High-Density Insulation and Ventilation for Tangential Cooling Prevents the kitchen and the furniture near the oven from getting too hot.</p><p><strong>For Complete Cleaning, Fold the Grill Coil The electric heating element of the grill can be lowered to more easily clean the upper portion of the cavity thanks to the articulated support.<br/></strong>For Complete Cleaning, Fold the Grill Coil The electric heating element of the grill can be lowered to more easily clean the upper portion of the cavity thanks to the articulated support.</p><p><strong>Easy Enamel Cleaning Grease can be cleaned more easily because it does not adhere to the surface.<br/></strong>Easy Enamel Cleaning Grease can be cleaned more easily because it does not adhere to the surface.</p><p><strong>Oven operation UOV 80 E3 TFT S</strong></p><p></p><ul><li>Pizza function</li><li>Defrosting</li><li>Cooking intensively</li><li>Quick start</li><li>Cooking with lots of moisture</li><li>Cooking on a fan grill</li><li>Grill cooking with a closed door</li><li>Cooking from above</li><li>Cooking that is moist from above</li><li>Cooking from below</li><li>Cooking that is moist from below</li><li>Normal cooking that is static</li><li>Cooking that is moist and static</li><li>Multiple fans cooking</li><li>Multiple moist fans cooking</li><li>Cooking ECO</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Pizza Function<br/></strong>Suitable for baking pizza, as well as bread and focaccia The lower heating element serves as the primary heat source and, along with the other underpowered heating elements, produces the ideal environment for this kind of cooking.</p><p><strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.<br/></strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.</p><p><strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.<br/></strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.</p><p><strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.<br/></strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.<br/></strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.</p><p><strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.<br/></strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.</p><p><strong>Cooking from Above It is especially good for browning and adding the last bit of color to many foods; it is the recommended function for burgers, pork chops, veal steaks, sole, cuttlefish, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking from Above It is especially good for browning and adding the last bit of color to many foods; it is the recommended function for burgers, pork chops, veal steaks, sole, cuttlefish, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture from Above Ideal for browning and giving many foods a final pop of color without sacrificing their tenderness.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture from Above Ideal for browning and giving many foods a final pop of color without sacrificing their tenderness.</p><p><strong>Cooking from the Ground Up Pastries (biscuits, meringues, leavened desserts, fruit desserts, etc.) are best cooked using this technique to finish the cooking cycle.<br/></strong>Cooking from the Ground Up Pastries (biscuits, meringues, leavened desserts, fruit desserts, etc.) are best cooked using this technique to finish the cooking cycle.</p><p><strong>Cooking Moist from Below This is the best cooking technique for finishing the cooking cycle while keeping the proper moisture content.<br/></strong>Cooking Moist from Below This is the best cooking technique for finishing the cooking cycle while keeping the proper moisture content.</p><p><strong>Pork chops, sausages, salt cod, braised meat, game, roast veal, meringues and biscuits, baked fruit, etc. can all be cooked in this traditional electric oven function. Cooking Static Normal<br/></strong>Pork chops, sausages, salt cod, braised meat, game, roast veal, meringues and biscuits, baked fruit, etc. can all be cooked in this traditional electric oven function. Cooking Static Normal</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moist Static This increases the moisture content of typical static cooking.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moist Static This increases the moisture content of typical static cooking.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Several Fans This feature enables cooking multiple dishes at once without the smells blending. Lasagna, croissants and brioches, tarts, cakes, etc. can be baked, saving time and electricity.<br/></strong>Cooking with Several Fans This feature enables cooking multiple dishes at once without the smells blending. Lasagna, croissants and brioches, tarts, cakes, etc. can be baked, saving time and electricity.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Several Moist Fans Multiple-fan cooking gains more moisture as a result.<br/></strong>Cooking with Several Moist Fans Multiple-fan cooking gains more moisture as a result.</p><p><strong>Cooking ECO This feature enables you to cook while using much less electricity. Braised meats, white meats, baked pasta, and delicate pastries are just a few examples of foods that benefit from slow roasting when using the ECO function. For frozen foods, this cooking cycle is not advised.<br/></strong>Cooking ECO This feature enables you to cook while using much less electricity. Braised meats, white meats, baked pasta, and delicate pastries are just a few examples of foods that benefit from slow roasting when using the ECO function. For frozen foods, this cooking cycle is not advised.</p><p></p><hr/><p></p><p><strong>Proposition 65 in California</strong></p><p>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm</p><p><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">P65Warnings.ca.gov</a></p></div> <div><div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/qIZ8MSDCu-Y.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/RRQlYvQPAMg.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/Uh_EEzfUhUU.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/wKi6ZYNcCxY.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/re1Uo4qdmcc.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/4JuPNm3uQqU.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/KQZi4YSuURw.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> <div> <video controls=\\\"\\\" preload=\\\"auto\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/8f9p_Cmu_Jo.mp4\\\" style=\\\"max-width:320px; margin-bottom:1.2rem;\\\">The video tag is not supported by your browser.</video> </div> </div></div><br/><br/><strong>Freight Charges May Apply</strong><br/><br/></div></div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_features\\\" aria-selected=\\\"false\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tab\\\" data-slug=\\\"features\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tab_features\\\" role=\\\"tab\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"> <span class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtext\\\">Features</span> </span></h3> <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_features\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_features\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"> <div><div><div><li><strong>ILVE Italian Design</strong></li></div><div>Crafted, not put together With centuries of experience and accuracy, each ILVE line is meticulously handcrafted in Campodarsego, Italy. The ILVE collections are more than just appliances; they are a reflection of Italian culture, created by skilled craftspeople who are proud of every little detail.</div><div><img alt=\\\"ILVE Italian Design\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1380.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Burner in total black brass with nanotechnology-based non-stick coating</strong></li></div><div>A nanotechnological coating that guarantees easy cleaning and an elegant Total Black finish enhance the noble technical qualities of brass.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Total Black Brass Burner With Non-Stick Nanotechnological Coating\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1447.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports</strong></li></div><div>The pots are safely and effectively supported by the unbreakable cast iron pan supports.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Cooktop (Hob) With Cast Iron Pan Supports\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1448.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Highly Customized Cooktops</strong></li></div><div>Choose your ideal combination of a gas burner cooktop or an induction cooktop, a mixed configuration, or a variety of setups thanks to the built-in AISI 304 steel and 12/10 thickness.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Highly Specialized Cooktops\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1449.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Dual Gas Burners With Up To 20,000 BTU Power As Standard</strong></li></div><div>For all cooking methods, the ideal supply and distribution of heat.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Dual Gas Burners With Power Up To 20000 BTU As Standard\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1474.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>4.3-inch Touchscreen</strong></li></div><div>The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glance, you can control the temperature, timer, and automatic cooking start and end programmer.</div><div><img alt=\\\"4.3 Inch Full Touch Display\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1475.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>ILVE's Magnificent Declaration</strong></li></div><div>A blend of modern technology and traditional Italian design that is both elegant and practical. Majestic is a daring, expert representation of the ideal range cooker that will adorn your house with its rounded shapes made of pure steel and meticulously crafted details.</div><div><img alt=\\\"ILVE\\u2019s Majestic Statement\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1496.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>The Statement Range Cooker That Makes Your Kitchen Special</strong></li></div><div>Aesthetics are important, but that's not all. To cook well and enjoyably, the best technologies are required. In order to consistently ensure the highest level of satisfaction, ILVE puts all of its research and experience to work for you, providing solutions that combine optimal performance with maximum simplicity, safety, and user-friendliness.</div><div><img alt=\\\"The Statement Range Cooker Which Makes Your Kitchen Unique\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/1497.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Cooking Green</strong></li></div><div>This feature enables you to cook while using much less electricity. Braised meats, white meats, baked pasta, and delicate pastries are all suitable for slow roasting thanks to the ECO function.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Eco Cooking\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/5175.jpg\\\"/></div></div><div><div><li><strong>Enamel Oven Interior Cleaning Made Simple</strong></li></div><div>Grease can be cleaned more easily because it does not adhere to the surface.</div><div><img alt=\\\"Easy Clean Enamel Oven Interior\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/13285.jpg\\\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_specification\\\" aria-selected=\\\"false\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tab\\\" data-slug=\\\"specification\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tab_specification\\\" role=\\\"tab\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"> <span class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtext\\\">Specifications</span> </span></h3> <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_specification\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_specification\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"> <ul><li><strong>Brand</strong>: ILVE</li><li><strong>Series</strong>: Majestic II</li><li><strong>Appliance Category</strong>: Range</li><br/><p><strong>Appearance</strong></p><li><strong>Color</strong>: Antique White</li><li><strong>Color Family</strong>: Antique White</li><li><strong>Design Style</strong>: Retro Style</li><li><strong>Trim</strong>: Burnished</li><br/><p><strong>Dimensions</strong></p><li><strong>Exterior Width</strong>: 36\\u2033</li><li><strong>Width</strong>: 35 7/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Depth</strong>: 29\\u2033</li><li><strong>Height</strong>: 38 1/2\\u2033</li><li><strong>Depth with Door Opened at 90 Degrees</strong>: 42 7/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Max Height with Cooktop and Legs</strong>: 36\\u2033</li><li><strong>Product Weight (lbs)</strong>: 287</li><br/><p><strong>Fuel Type</strong></p><li><strong>Fuel Type</strong>: Dual Fuel</li><li><strong>Gas Type</strong>: Natural Gas</li><br/><p><strong>Style</strong></p><li><strong>Style</strong>: Freestanding</li><li><strong>Control Location</strong>: Front</li><br><p><strong>Capacity</strong></p><li><strong>Total Capacity (cu. ft.)</strong>: 3.5</li><li><strong>Number of Ovens</strong>: Single Oven</li><br><p><strong>Cooking Surface</strong></p><li><strong>Cooktop Configuration</strong>: 6 Sealed Burners + Griddle</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Type</strong>: Sealed Burner</li><li><strong>Number of Burners/Elements</strong>: 6</li><li><strong>Grill</strong>: No</li><li><strong>Griddle</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>French Top</strong>: No</li><li><strong>Highest Burner Output</strong>: 20000 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N1</strong>: 20000 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N2</strong>: 7000 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N3</strong>: 7000 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N4</strong>: 10500 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N5</strong>: 10500 BTU</li><li><strong>Burner/Element Output N6</strong>: 10500 BTU</li><br><p><strong>Oven</strong></p><li><strong>Easy-Glide Racks</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Oven Control Type</strong>: TFT Electronic Touchscreen</li><li><strong>Oven Door Type</strong>: Triple Glass Door</li><li><strong>Oven Cleaning Type</strong>: Easy Clean Enamel Cavities</li><li><strong>Interior Oven Light</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Interior Width</strong>: 26 3/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Interior Height</strong>: 14 3/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Interior Depth</strong>: 16 1/8\\u2033</li><br><p><strong>Technical Details</strong></p><li><strong>Voltage</strong>: 240</li><li><strong>Amps</strong>: 18.1</li><br/><p><strong>Certifications</strong