1218_p16376-1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE G4221218 Scroll Claw Leg (Sold by Individual Leg) (Burnished)</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>242.00</bdi></span></a></div><div><a href=\\\"/search?q=ilve+kgset001\\\"><div><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/KGSET001_p20076.jpg\\\" width=\\\"115\\\"/></div><div>ILVE KGSET001 Total Extension Glide Racks</div><span><bdi><span>$</span>168.00</bdi></span></a></div></div> </div> </div> </div> \", \"Option1 Name\": \"Color\", \"Option1 Value\": \"Burgundy\", \"Option2 Name\": \"Trim\", \"Option2 Value\": \"Copper\", \"Option3 Name\": \"Gas Type\", \"Option3 Value\": \"Natural Gas\", \"Option4 Name\": \"Oven Door Type\", \"Option4 Value\": \"Triple Glass Door\"}, {\"Variant Name\": \"ILVE - 36 inch Majestic II Dual Fuel Range with 6 Black Brass Burners, Griddle (Burgundy / Copper / Liquid Propane / Triple Glass Door) - UM09FDNS3BUPLP\", \"Variant SKU\": \"UM09FDNS3BUPLP\", \"Variant Image\": \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147-1536x1536.jpg\", \"Variant All Images\": [\"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147-1536x1536.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_171405.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_171406.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_171407.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148754.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148755.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148756.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_15392-1536x1016.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148757.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148758.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_15391.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_148759.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDNS3BUPLP_p104147_32210.jpg\"], \"Variant Price\": \"7890.00\", \"Variant Barcode\": \"8051202189781\", \"Variant URLS\": \"\", \"Variant Count\": \"\", \"Variant HTML\": \" <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_description\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel station-tabs-default-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_description\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><p>The Majestic 36\\\" dual fuel range combines cutting-edge technology with traditional Italian design. This line includes six gas burners and a griddle, each with a 3.5 cu. total black brass burner with a non-stick nanotechnological coating. sq. total oven capacity, 4.3-inch full touch oven control display, and easily cleaned enamel oven cavity.</p><p>Pre-Order (90\\u2013120 Days)</p><div><p><strong>Magnificent</strong></p><p>The eye-catching range cooker that makes your kitchen distinctive.</p><p></p><p>Majestic is a daring, expert representation of the ideal range cooker, combining beauty and functionality. A free-standing statement piece with a style that features rounded lines, expertly crafted details, exquisite finishes, solutions, and technologies straight from the world of professional cooking that instantly takes center stage and blends into any setting.</p><p></p><p>The rounded shapes of majestic range cookers, which are crafted from pure steel with meticulously made details, make them aesthetically pleasing appliances.</p><p></p><p>They are genuine works of art, created for your home's kitchen. They come with exquisite metallic finishes and are offered in a variety of chosen colors or in RAL Classic shades upon request. They are available in a variety of sizes (from 30 to 60 inches) and provide a number of setup options. There are three cooktop (hob) configurations to choose from: fry top, dual gas burners, and induction models up to 40 inches in size.</p><p></p><ul><li>Dual gas burners with a maximum power of 20,000 BTU are standard.</li><li>Highly specialized cooktops</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li><li>4.3\\\" Digital Touch Screen Display</li><li>Black brass burner with non-stick coating<br/>Nanotechnological coating</li><li>Cooktop with cast iron pan supports.</li><li>Soft-closing door and drawer</li><li>Steam release for moist cooking</li><li>True, stand-alone warming drawer</li><li>Probe for cooking</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Product Technologies</strong></p><p>Aesthetics are important, but that's not all. To cook well and enjoyably, the best technologies are required. In order to consistently ensure the highest level of satisfaction, ILVE puts all of its research and experience to work for you, providing solutions that combine optimal performance with maximum simplicity, safety, and user-friendliness.</p><p></p><p><span><strong>Cooktop (Hob) Technology</strong></span></p><p></p><p><strong>Dual Gas Burners with Up to 20,000 BTU Power as Standard For all cooking methods, the ideal supply and distribution of heat.<br/></strong>Dual Gas Burners with Up to 20,000 BTU Power as Standard For all cooking methods, the ideal supply and distribution of heat.</p><p><strong>Highly Customized Cooktops The structure is made of AISI 304 steel and has a thickness of 12/10. You can choose between an induction cooktop or a gas cooktop (hob) with up to 9 burners, mixed, and in different configurations.<br/></strong>Highly Customized Cooktops The structure is made of AISI 304 steel and has a thickness of 12/10. You can choose between an induction cooktop or a gas cooktop (hob) with up to 9 burners, mixed, and in different configurations.</p><p><strong>Total Black Brass Burner with Nanotechnological Non-Stick Coating A nanotechnological coating that guarantees easy cleaning and an elegant Total Black finish enhance the noble technical qualities of brass.<br/></strong>Total Black Brass Burner with Nanotechnological Non-Stick Coating A nanotechnological coating that guarantees easy cleaning and an elegant Total Black finish enhance the noble technical qualities of brass.</p><p><strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports The pots are safely and effectively supported by the unbreakable cast iron pan supports.<br/></strong>Cooktop (Hob) with Cast Iron Pan Supports The pots are safely and effectively supported by the unbreakable cast iron pan supports.</p><p></p><hr/><p></p><p><span><strong>Oven Technology</strong></span></p><p></p><p><strong>The Ovens: Magnificent Size and Performance. Any single or double combination oven you select will give you all the space you require, even for large dishes. Our 36-inch range has an oven capacity of up to 4 cubic feet.<br/></strong>The Ovens: Magnificent Size and Performance. Any single or double combination oven you select will give you all the space you require, even for large dishes. Our 36-inch range has an oven capacity of up to 4 cubic feet.</p><p><strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.<br/></strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.</p><p><strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.<br/></strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.</p><p><strong>User-Friendly, Comprehensive, and High Resolution TFT Display. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glanc