O</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Pizza Function<br/></strong>Suitable for baking pizza, as well as bread and focaccia The lower heating element serves as the primary heat source and, along with the other underpowered heating elements, produces the ideal environment for this kind of cooking.</p><p><strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.<br/></strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.</p><p><strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.<br/></strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.</p><p><strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.<br/></strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foo