gas burners and a griddle, each with a 3.5 cu. total black brass burner with a non-stick nanotechnological coating. sq. total oven capacity, 4.3-inch full touch oven control display, and easily cleaned enamel oven cavity.</p><p>Pre-Order (90\\u2013120 Days)</p><div><p><strong>Magnificent</strong></p><p>The eye-catching range cooker that makes your kitchen distinctive.</p><p></p><p>Majestic is a daring, expert representation of the ideal range cooker, combining beauty and functionality. A free-standing statement piece with a style that features rounded lines, expertly crafted details, exquisite finishes, solutions, and technologies straight from the world of professional cooking that instantly takes center stage and blends into any setting.</p><p></p><p>The rounded shapes of majestic range cookers, which are crafted from pure steel with meticulously made details, make them aesthetically pleasing appliances.</p><p></p><p>They are genuine works of art, created for your home's kitchen. They come with exquisite metallic finishes and are offered in a variety of chosen colors or in RAL Classic shades upon request. They are available in a variety of sizes (from 30 to 60 inches) and provide a number of setup options. There are three cooktop (hob) configurations to choose from: fry top, dual gas burners, and induction models up to 40 inches in size.</p><p></p><ul><li>Dual gas burners with a maximum power of 20,000 BTU are standard.</li><li>Highly specialized cooktops</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li><li>4.3\\\" Digital Touch Screen Display</li><li>Black brass burner with non-stick coating<br/>Nanotechnological coating</li><li>Cooktop with cast iron pan supports.</li><li>Soft-closing door and drawer</li><li>Steam release for moist cooking</li><li>True, stand-alone warming drawer</li><li>Probe for cooking</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Product Technologies</strong></p><p>Aesthetics are important, but that's not all. To cook well and enjoyably, the best technologi