uest to arrive or for another meal to be prepared, keep your cooking warm. Warming Drawer with Soft Closing System A useful feature for keeping the ideal temperature to showcase your culinary prowess You can also use the compartment as a storage drawer for your pots, pans, and cooking utensils when it's not in use.<br/></strong>While you wait for your guest to arrive or for another meal to be prepared, keep your cooking warm. Warming Drawer with Soft Closing System A useful feature for keeping the ideal temperature to showcase your culinary prowess You can also use the compartment as a storage drawer for your pots, pans, and cooking utensils when it's not in use.</p><p><strong>Cooking Probe An indispensable tool for determining the core temperature, such as in meat cuts.<br/></strong>Cooking Probe An indispensable tool for determining the core temperature, such as in meat cuts.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Steam You can select a drier or more moist cooking method thanks to this system, which removes the vapors from inside the cavity. You can produce a soft and juicy roast or a crispy baked dish in this manner.<br/></strong>Cooking with Steam You can select a drier or more moist cooking method thanks to this system, which removes the vapors from inside the cavity. You can produce a soft and juicy roast or a crispy baked dish in this manner.</p><p><strong>Temperature ranging from 85\\u00b0 to 575\\u00b0 F ILVE ovens make it simple to prepare intricate and sophisticated recipes with flawless results, from proofing to cooking, roasting to low temperature.<br/></strong>Temperature ranging from 85\\u00b0 to 575\\u00b0 F ILVE ovens make it simple to prepare intricate and sophisticated recipes with flawless results, from proofing to cooking, roasting to low temperature.</p><p><strong>High-Density Insulation and Ventilation for Tangential Cooling Prevents the kitchen and the furniture near the oven from getting too hot.<br/></strong>High-Density Insulation and Ventilation for 