, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.<br/></strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.</p><p><strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.<br/></strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.<br/></strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.</p><p><strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.<br/></strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.</p><p><strong>Cooking from Above 