 Easy Clean Enamel Cavities</li><li><strong>Interior Oven Light</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Interior Width</strong>: 26 3/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Interior Height</strong>: 14 3/8\\u2033</li><li><strong>Interior Depth</strong>: 16 1/8\\u2033</li><br><p><strong>Technical Details</strong></p><li><strong>Voltage</strong>: 240</li><li><strong>Amps</strong>: 18.1</li><br/><p><strong>Certifications</strong></p><li><strong>Star-K Certified</strong>: Yes</li><br/><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><li><strong>Warranty</strong>: 2 Year Parts and Labor</li><br/><p><strong>Features</strong></p><li><strong>Convection</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Steam Discharge</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Auto Shut Off</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Sabbath Mode</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Display Type</strong>: TFT Display</li><li><strong>Drawer</strong>: Warming Drawer</li><li><strong>Child Lock</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Timer</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Range Leg Type</strong>: Plinth</li><li><strong>Temperature Probe</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Rotisserie</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Continuous Grates</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Digital Clock</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Soft Close Door</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Delay Bake</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>Gas Conversion Kit Included</strong>: Yes</li><li><strong>European Convection</strong>: Yes</li></br></br></br></br></ul> </div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_shipping-returns\\\" aria-selected=\\\"false\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tab\\\" data-slug=\\\"shipping-returns\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tab_shipping-returns\\\" role=\\\"tab\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"> <span class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtext\\\">Shipping/Returns</span> </span></h3> <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_shipping-returns\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_shipping-returns\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent