 as well as bread and focaccia The lower heating element serves as the primary heat source and, along with the other underpowered heating elements, produces the ideal environment for this kind of cooking.</p><p><strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.<br/></strong>Defrosting Assures that all frozen food is quickly defrosted and brought to room temperature without losing its flavor or appearance.</p><p><strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.<br/></strong>Cooking intensively With steam discharge, it guarantees quick and thorough cooking. Baked potatoes and vegetables, chicken, salt-crusted fish, etc. are advised for a crispy outcome.</p><p><strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.<br/></strong>Quick start With the quick preheating function, you can quickly reach your desired temperature before selecting the cooking mode that best suits your dish. When set to a low temperature, it also functions as a quick defrosting device.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture The steam block ensures rapid and thorough cooking. It is advised for moist cooking, such as chicken cacciatore, braised meat, stewed rabbit, salt cod, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.<br/></strong>Cooking on a Fan Grill This function is especially quick and deep, and it saves a lot of energy. It can be used for a variety of foods, including game, pork chops, sausages, pork or mixed kebabs, and Roman-style gnocchi.</p><p><strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.<br/></strong>Grill Cooking with a Closed Door Recommended for quick and deep grilling, browning, and roasting meat in general, fillet, Florentine steak, fish, and even vegetables.</p><p><strong>Cooking from Above It is especially good for browning and adding the last bit of color to many foods; it is the recommended function for burgers, pork chops, veal steaks, sole, cuttlefish, etc.<br/></strong>Cooking from Above It is especially good for browning and adding the last bit of color to many foods; it is the recommended function for burgers, pork chops, veal steaks, sole, cuttlefish, etc.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moisture from Above Ideal for browning and giving many foods a final pop of color without sacrificing their tenderness.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moisture from Above Ideal for browning and giving many foods a final pop of color without sacrificing their tenderness.</p><p><strong>Cooking from the Ground Up Pastries (biscuits, meringues, leavened desserts, fruit desserts, etc.) are best cooked using this technique to finish the cooking cycle.<br/></strong>Cooking from the Ground Up Pastries (biscuits, meringues, leavened desserts, fruit desserts, etc.) are best cooked using this technique to finish the cooking cycle.</p><p><strong>Cooking Moist from Below This is the best cooking technique for finishing the cooking cycle while keeping the proper moisture content.<br/></strong>Cooking Moist from Below This is the best cooking technique for finishing the cooking cycle while keeping the proper moisture content.</p><p><strong>Cooking Static Normal Pork chops, sausages, salt cod, braised meat, game, roast veal, meringues and biscuits, baked fruit, etc. can all be cooked in this traditional electric oven function.<br/></strong>Cooking Static Normal Pork chops, sausages, salt cod, braised meat, game, roast veal, meringues and biscuits, baked fruit, etc. can all be cooked in this traditional electric oven function.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Moist Static This increases the moisture content of typical static cooking.<br/></strong>Cooking with Moist Static This increases the moisture content of typical static cooking.</p><p><strong>This feature enables cooking multiple dishes at once without the smells blending. Cooking with Several Fans Lasagna, croissants and brioches, tarts, cakes, etc. can be baked, saving time and electricity.<br/></strong>This feature enables cooking multiple dishes at once without the smells blending. Cooking with Several Fans Lasagna, croissants and brioches, tarts, cakes, etc. can be baked, saving time and electricity.</p><p><strong>Cooking with Several Moist Fans Multiple-fan cooking gains more moisture as a result.<br/></strong>Cooking with Several Moist Fans Multiple-fan cooking gains more moisture as a result.</p><p><strong>Cooking ECO This feature enables you to cook while using much less electricity. Braised meats, white meats, baked pasta, and delicate pastries are just a few examples of foods that benefit from slow roasting when using the ECO function. For frozen foods, this cooking cycle is not advised.<br/></strong>Cooking ECO This feature enables you to cook while using much less electricity. Braised meats, white meats, baked pasta, and delicate pastries are just a few examples of foods that benefit from slow roasting when using the ECO function. For frozen foods, this cooking cycle is not advised.</p><p></p><hr/><p></p><p><strong>Proposition 65 in California</strong></p><p>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm</p><p><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target