olid Door) - UM09FDQNS3SSPLP\", \"Variant SKU\": \"UM09FDQNS3SSPLP\", \"Variant Image\": \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196.jpg\", \"Variant All Images\": [\"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_171809.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_171810.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_171811.webp\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150215.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150216.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150217.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150218.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150219.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_150220.jpg\", \"https://us.ilve.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/UM09FDQNS3SSPLP_p104196_32938.jpg\"], \"Variant Price\": \"8590.00\", \"Variant Barcode\": \"8051202224918\", \"Variant URLS\": \"\", \"Variant Count\": \"\", \"Variant HTML\": \" <div aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"station-tabs-tab_description\\\" class=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel station-tabs-default-tabpanel\\\" id=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_description\\\" role=\\\"tabpanel\\\"> <div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><div class=\\\"station-tabs-tabcontent\\\"><p>The Majestic 36\\\" dual fuel range combines cutting-edge technology with traditional Italian design. This line includes six gas burners and a griddle, each with a 3.5 cu. total black brass burner with a non-stick nanotechnological coating. sq. total oven capacity, 4.3-inch full touch oven control display, and easily cleaned enamel oven cavity.</p><p>Pre-Order (90\\u2013120 Days)</p><div><p><strong>Magnificent</strong></p><p>The eye-catching range cooker that makes your kitchen distinctive.</p><p></p><p>Majestic is a daring, expert representation of the ideal range cooker, combining beauty and functionality. A free-standing statement piece with a style that features rounded lines, expertly crafted details, exquisite finishes, solutions, and technologies straight from the world of professional cooking that instantly takes center stage and blends into any setting.</p><p></p><p>The rounded shapes of majestic range cookers, which are crafted from pure steel with meticulously made details, make them aesthetically pleasing appliances.</p><p></p><p>They are genuine works of art, created for your home's kitchen. They come with exquisite metallic finishes and are offered in a variety of chosen colors or in RAL Classic shades upon request. They are available in a variety of sizes (from 30 to 60 inches) and provide a number of setup options. There are three cooktop (hob) configurations to choose from: fry top, dual gas burners, and induction models up to 40 inches in size.</p><p></p><ul><li>Dual gas burners with a maximum power of 20,000 BTU are standard.</li><li>Highly specialized cooktops</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li><li>4.3\\\" Digital Touch Screen Display</li><li>Black brass burner with non-stick coating<br/>Nanotechnological coating</li><li>Cooktop with cast iron pan supports.</li><li>Soft-closing door and drawer</li><li>Steam release for moist cooking</li><li>True, stand-alone warming drawer</li><li>Probe for cooking</li></ul><hr/><p><strong>Product Technologies</strong></p><p>Aesthetics are important, but that's not all. To cook well and enjoyably, the best technologies are required. In order to consistently ensure the highest level of satisfaction, ILVE puts all of its research and experience to work for you, providing solutions that combine optimal performance with maximum simplicity, safety, and user-friendliness.</p><p></p><p><span><strong>Cooktop (Hob) Technology</strong></span></p><p></p><p><strong>For all 