 feet.</p><p><strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.<br/></strong>Accurate Electronic Temperature Control The electronic control makes sure that the oven's temperature doesn't change throughout, unlike in traditional ovens.</p><p><strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.<br/></strong>4.3\\\" Touchscreen The display's superior readability is guaranteed by TFT technology, which provides instantaneous, clear graphics for each function.</p><p><strong>User-Friendly, Comprehensive, and High Resolution TFT Display. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glance, you can control the temperature, timer, and automatic cooking start and end programmer.<br/></strong>User-Friendly, Comprehensive, and High Resolution TFT Display. To control all of the features of the single oven or the two ovens with a single device, just touch the large display with one finger. With a single motion and a quick glance, you can control the temperature, timer, and automatic cooking start and end programmer.</p><p><strong>Soft-Closing Door A shock absorber installed in the door hinges allows for a more gradual and silent closing.<br/></strong>Soft-Closing Door A shock absorber installed in the door hinges allows for a more gradual and silent closing.</p><p><strong>Warming Drawer with Soft Closing System While you wait for your guest to arrive or for another meal to be prepared, keep your cooking warm. A useful feature for keeping the ideal temperature to showcase your culinary prowess You can also use the compartment as a storage drawer for your pots, pans, and cooking utensils when it's not in use.<br/></strong>Warming Drawer with So